@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ktv-nouns`
IMPORT `ktv-annex5-cancer`

-- Tests for Annex 5: each exclusion of (1)-(3) triggered and missed, and which definition a set
-- of findings lands in. Expected values were read from the source (src 2111-2287) before writing.

§ `Tests — Annex 5, cancer`

§§ `Fixture`

GIVEN `p confined`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `p invasive`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `p clinical`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `p class`     IS A `Histological classification`
      `p RAI`       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `p site`      IS A `Primary site`
      `p melanoma`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `p beyond`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `p spread`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `p T1`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `p mitoses`   IS A NUMBER
      `p HIV`       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings on a cancer`
`a tumour, confined` `p confined` `invasive` `p invasive` `clinical only` `p clinical` `class` `p class` `RAI` `p RAI` `site` `p site` `melanoma` `p melanoma` `beyond epidermis` `p beyond` `spread` `p spread` `T1N0M0` `p T1` `mitoses` `p mitoses` `HIV` `p HIV` MEANS
    `Findings on a cancer` WITH
        `diagnosed by an oncologist`                                        IS TRUE
        `confirmed by histopathology or anatomical pathology`               IS TRUE
        `confirmed positive on a biopsy examined under a microscope`        IS TRUE
        `diagnosed from clinical signs only`                                IS `p clinical`
        `new cancer cells confined to the primary site, not invading or destroying surrounding tissue` IS `p confined`
        `uncontrolled growth of malignant cells invading surrounding tissue` IS `p invasive`
        `a malignant tumour, leukaemia, lymphoma or sarcoma`                IS `p invasive`
        `histological classification`                                       IS `p class`
        `RAI stage of chronic lymphocytic leukaemia`                        IS `p RAI`
        `primary site`                                                      IS `p site`
        `a melanoma`                                                        IS `p melanoma`
        `described histologically as in situ`                               IS `p confined`
        `invading beyond the epidermis`                                     IS `p beyond`
        `spread to lymph nodes or distant sites`                            IS `p spread`
        `TNM T1N0M0 or lower, or an equivalent or lower classification`     IS `p T1`
        `mitotic count per 50 high-power fields`                            IS `p mitoses`
        `in a person infected with HIV`                                     IS `p HIV`

GIVEN `the class` IS A `Histological classification`
      `the site`  IS A `Primary site`
      `T1`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `mitoses`   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Findings on a cancer`
`an invasive cancer of class` `the class` `at` `the site` `, T1N0M0:` `T1` `, mitoses` `mitoses` MEANS
    `a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` TRUE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `the class` `RAI` NOTHING `site` `the site` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` `T1` `mitoses` `mitoses` `HIV` FALSE

GIVEN `the class` IS A `Histological classification`
      `the site`  IS A `Primary site`
      `T1`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `clinical only` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Findings on a cancer`
`an in-situ cancer of class` `the class` `at` `the site` `, T1N0M0:` `T1` `, clinical only:` `clinical only` MEANS
    `a tumour, confined` TRUE `invasive` FALSE `clinical only` `clinical only` `class` `the class` `RAI` NOTHING `site` `the site` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` `T1` `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE

§§ `3. Major cancer (src 2204-2229)`

#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`an invasive cancer of class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, mitoses` 0) EQUALS JUST `major cancer`
-- (a) excludes low malignant potential, but not "of malignant potential", which (a) does not name.
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`an invasive cancer of class` `of low malignant potential` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, mitoses` 0)
#ASSERT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`an invasive cancer of class` `of malignant potential` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, mitoses` 0)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`an invasive cancer of class` `CIN III, carcinoma in situ` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, mitoses` 0)
-- (b) chronic lymphocytic leukaemia below RAI stage 3 is excluded; stage 3 is not.
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` TRUE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` (JUST 2) `site` `another site` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` TRUE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` (JUST 3) `site` `another site` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE)
-- (c) a melanoma not through the epidermis; (d) a non-melanoma skin cancer that has not spread.
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` TRUE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` NOTHING `site` `the skin` `melanoma` TRUE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` TRUE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` NOTHING `site` `the skin` `melanoma` TRUE `beyond epidermis` TRUE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` TRUE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` NOTHING `site` `the skin` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` TRUE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` NOTHING `site` `the skin` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` TRUE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE)
-- (e)-(g) T1N0M0 prostate, thyroid, bladder: not major, and so (not excluded from (1)) early-stage.
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`an invasive cancer of class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `at` `the prostate` `, T1N0M0:` TRUE `, mitoses` 0) EQUALS JUST `early-stage cancer`
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`an invasive cancer of class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `at` `the thyroid` `, T1N0M0:` TRUE `, mitoses` 0) EQUALS JUST `early-stage cancer`
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`an invasive cancer of class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `at` `the bladder` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, mitoses` 0) EQUALS JUST `major cancer`
-- (h) a T1N0M0 GIST with 5 mitoses per 50 HPF is excluded; with 6 it is major.
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`an invasive cancer of class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `at` `a gastrointestinal stromal tumour` `, T1N0M0:` TRUE `, mitoses` 5)
#ASSERT `Annex 5(3) — the findings meet the definition of major cancer` (`an invasive cancer of class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `at` `a gastrointestinal stromal tumour` `, T1N0M0:` TRUE `, mitoses` 6)
-- (i) a cancer in a person with HIV: excluded from all three definitions.
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` TRUE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` NOTHING `site` `another site` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `2. Carcinoma in situ (src 2135-2202)`

#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`an in-situ cancer of class` `carcinoma in situ, by histology` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, clinical only:` FALSE) EQUALS JUST `carcinoma in situ`
-- A cervical carcinoma in situ (CIN III that is carcinoma in situ) is not excluded from (2)(a).
#ASSERT `Annex 5(2) — the findings meet the definition of carcinoma in situ` (`an in-situ cancer of class` `CIN III, carcinoma in situ` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, clinical only:` FALSE)
-- CIN III severe dysplasia is excluded from (2) and (1): no cancer the product covers.
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`an in-situ cancer of class` `CIN III, severe dysplasia` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, clinical only:` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Diagnosed from clinical signs only: not (2).
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(2) — the findings meet the definition of carcinoma in situ` (`an in-situ cancer of class` `carcinoma in situ, by histology` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, clinical only:` TRUE)
-- (d) a T1N0M0 prostate carcinoma in situ is excluded from (2), and falls to (1).
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`an in-situ cancer of class` `carcinoma in situ, by histology` `at` `the prostate` `, T1N0M0:` TRUE `, clinical only:` FALSE) EQUALS JUST `early-stage cancer`

§§ `1. Early-stage cancer (src 2118-2129)`

#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`an in-situ cancer of class` `borderline malignancy` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, clinical only:` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` FALSE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` (JUST 0) `site` `another site` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` FALSE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` (JUST 1) `site` `another site` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE) EQUALS JUST `early-stage cancer`
#ASSERT `Annex 5 — the cancer the findings establish` (`a tumour, confined` FALSE `invasive` FALSE `clinical only` FALSE `class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `RAI` NOTHING `site` `the skin` `melanoma` FALSE `beyond epidermis` FALSE `spread` FALSE `T1N0M0` FALSE `mitoses` 0 `HIV` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `4. Extended major cancer (src 2235-2287)`

`the insured born 1950` MEANS `Insured person` WITH
    `date of birth`                                       IS YMD 1950 6 10
    `sex`                                                 IS `female`
    `living in Vietnam when the application was submitted` IS TRUE
    `one in whom the policyowner has an insurable interest` IS TRUE
    `accepted for insurance by the Company`               IS TRUE

`the 1950 policy` MEANS Policy WITH
    `effective date`                           IS YMD 2022 3 15
    `date the Company accepted the insurance`  IS YMD 2022 3 20
    `date of the latest reinstatement`         IS NOTHING
    `premium frequency`                        IS `yearly`
    `the insured`                              IS `the insured born 1950`
    `the policyowner`                          IS Policyowner WITH `kind` IS `an individual`, `age in completed years` IS 45, `full civil legal capacity` IS TRUE, `lawfully established and operating in Vietnam` IS FALSE, `alive` IS TRUE

GIVEN `the finding` IS A `Further finding after a major cancer`
      `the other`   IS A MAYBE `Findings on a cancer`
      `the date`    IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Findings on extended major cancer`
`a further finding` `the finding` `, other cancer` `the other` `, on` `the date` MEANS `Findings on extended major cancer` WITH
    `the further finding`                                 IS `the finding`
    `findings on the other cancer`                        IS `the other`
    `date of the major cancer diagnosis`                  IS YMD 2024 1 10
    `the major cancer benefit was accepted for payment`   IS TRUE
    `date of the further diagnosis or confirmation`       IS `the date`

-- "sau 02 năm": a recurrence on the second anniversary of the diagnosis is too soon; the day after is in time.
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(4) — under` `the 1950 policy` `, extended major cancer is payable on` (`a further finding` `the major cancer has recurred` `, other cancer` NOTHING `, on` (YMD 2026 1 10))
#ASSERT `Annex 5(4) — under` `the 1950 policy` `, extended major cancer is payable on` (`a further finding` `the major cancer has recurred` `, other cancer` NOTHING `, on` (YMD 2026 1 11))
-- (a)(iv) another, unrelated cancer must itself meet the major cancer definition.
#ASSERT `Annex 5(4) — under` `the 1950 policy` `, extended major cancer is payable on` (`a further finding` `another major cancer unrelated to the earlier one` `, other cancer` (JUST (`an invasive cancer of class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `at` `another site` `, T1N0M0:` FALSE `, mitoses` 0)) `, on` (YMD 2027 1 1))
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(4) — under` `the 1950 policy` `, extended major cancer is payable on` (`a further finding` `another major cancer unrelated to the earlier one` `, other cancer` (JUST (`an invasive cancer of class` `none of the classes the exclusions name` `at` `the thyroid` `, T1N0M0:` TRUE `, mitoses` 0)) `, on` (YMD 2027 1 1))
-- (b)(ii) the 85th birthday is 2035-06-10; cover runs to the day before the 2036-03-15 anniversary.
#ASSERT `Annex 5(4) — under` `the 1950 policy` `, extended major cancer is payable on` (`a further finding` `the major cancer has spread to other parts of the body` `, other cancer` NOTHING `, on` (YMD 2036 3 14))
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 5(4) — under` `the 1950 policy` `, extended major cancer is payable on` (`a further finding` `the major cancer has spread to other parts of the body` `, other cancer` NOTHING `, on` (YMD 2036 3 15))
